WEBVTT

00:01:56.529 --> 00:02:00.741
uzun bog’ichli arqon
va qarshi og’irlikdagi tosh,

00:02:00.741 --> 00:02:04.620
Biz hozirgina
zamonaviy kosmik liftni tasavvur qildik -

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:09.417
aylanayotgan sayyoramiz fizikasi
tomonidan kosmosga tortilgan kabel .

00:02:10.376 --> 00:02:14.380
Buning ishlashi uchun qarshi og’irlik
etarlicha uzoqda bo’lishi kerak

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:17.842
Yerning aylanishi natijasida
hosil bo’lgan markazdan qochma kuch

00:02:17.842 --> 00:02:21.262
sayyoraning
tortishish kuchidan kattaroqdir .

00:02:21.262 --> 00:02:27.101
Bu kuchlar sirtdan taxmiman 36 000 km
balandlikda muvozanatni saqlaydi ,

00:02:27.101 --> 00:02:30.688
shuning uchun qarshi og’irlik bu
balandlikdan  tashqarida bo’lishi kerak .